          "id": "service.robotaxi-shop.root.topic.fares",
          "label": "Who collects the fares?",
          "receipt": "You do. The car handles the driving and completed fares go into your purse. You’re buying a car to work in the fleet. If you just want a ride across town, you can call a Waymo from your travel controls.",
