          "id": "service.growth-exchange.root.choices.1"
        },
        {
          "id": "service.growth-exchange.root.topic.quotes",
          "label": "How should I read the quote?",
          "receipt": "It tells you what the market is offering for the shares right now. There’s a separate listing fee when you first go public, and you can ask me to sell while the shares are trading. I can read out today’s price. I can’t tell you where it will go.",
