  "simulation_sunlight": {
    "id": "simulation_sunlight",
    "title": "Someone put in the sunlight",
    "tags": ["simulation"],
    "start": "start",
    "nodes": {
      "start": {
        "id": "start",
        "text": "Do you ever think we might be in a simulation? Somebody would have had to put all these little yellow flowers here. I like that idea.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "start.choice-1",
            "text": "What if nobody put them here?",
            "next": "end-1"
          },
          {
            "id": "start.choice-2",
            "text": "What would you put in a simulation?",
            "next": "end-2"
          }
        ]
      },
      "end-1": {
        "id": "end-1",
        "text": "Then I get to like the flowers anyway.",
        "end": true
      },
      "end-2": {
        "id": "end-2",
        "text": "More warm afternoons. And one enormous dog.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "simulation_goodbye": {
    "id": "simulation_goodbye",
    "title": "Pause instead of goodbye",
    "tags": ["simulation"],
    "start": "start",
    "nodes": {
      "start": {
        "id": "start",
        "text": "If this is a simulation, do you think people are still out there when you stop seeing them? My friend moved away. I keep thinking how nice it would be if I could load a day when she was still here.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "start.choice-1",
            "text": "What would you do that day?",
            "next": "end-1"
          },
          {
            "id": "start.choice-2",
            "text": "Have you talked to her since?",
            "next": "end-2"
          }
        ]
      },
      "end-1": {
        "id": "end-1",
        "text": "Ask her to wait while I caught up. We always walked home too fast.",
        "end": true
      },
      "end-2": {
        "id": "end-2",
        "text": "We wrote each other letters. I should write another one.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "simulation_small_things": {
    "id": "simulation_small_things",
    "title": "Someone chose the details",
    "tags": ["simulation"],
    "start": "start",
    "nodes": {
      "start": {
        "id": "start",
        "text": "Sometimes the clouds look so deliberate that I wonder if we’re in a simulation. I’d be all right with that. Whoever chose the fog also remembered the smell of toast.",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "start.choice-1",
            "text": "What do you think they forgot?",
            "next": "end-1"
          },
          {
            "id": "start.choice-2",
            "text": "Would you want to know for sure?",
            "next": "end-2"
          }
        ]
      },
      "end-1": {
        "id": "end-1",
        "text": "A way to stop the smoke alarm before the toast burns.",
        "end": true
      },
      "end-2": {
        "id": "end-2",
        "text": "Maybe on a rainy afternoon, when I had time to think about it.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  }
}
