    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.decline-10": {
      "template": "Leave"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.intro-12": {
      "template": "Welcome to Jurassic Biosciences. We’re on the field side of the lab, which means we get the clipboards with the thickest covers. There’s a containment test on the schedule today. I could use help outside the fence, if you have a minute."
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.question-13": {
      "template": "Ask for a quest?"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.choice-14": {
      "template": "Do you have a quest for me?"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.briefing.intro": {
      "template": "We ran the drill with an empty cage. Now we’re trying it with the raptor inside. I’ll loan you a fully charged railgun for the hunt. Defeat the raptor to unlock it for other targets. Chase it south before it reaches the pedestrians, then bring me its remains."
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.briefing.accept": {
      "template": "I’ll recover the raptor."
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.intro-17": {
      "template": "You made it back. Put the specimen case on the bench and take a minute. I’ve been filling out the field report, and I think your account of what happened will be more useful than mine."
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.question-18": {
      "template": "Why did you release the raptor?"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.choice-19": {
      "template": "Hand over the remains and demand an explanation"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.intro-22": {
      "template": "This was a good test of the raptor escape and emergency recovery protocol."
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.question-23": {
      "template": "May I keep the railgun?"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.choice-24": {
      "template": "Confirm equipment ownership"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.receipt-25": {
      "template": "Certainly. We have classified it as a customer-success expense."
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.intro-27": {
      "template": "The raptor tends to head south toward the road. If you find the cage shut with the raptor back inside, come see me. I can run the gate again. I’d rather we use the controls than try to persuade a latch by hand."
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.question-28": {
      "template": "What am I supposed to do?"
    },
    "jurassic.scientistDialogue.choice-29": {
      "template": "Check the cage"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.intro-32.yes": {
      "template": "A fine hunt. Fine shooting! Collect the spoils from the deck. The cape is, regrettably, mandatory."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.intro-32.no": {
      "template": "There she is! Rather more arms than I remember from the prospectus."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.question-33": {
      "template": "Return to the city?"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.choice-34": {
      "template": "Sail back to shore"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.decline-35": {
      "template": "Stay aboard"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.intro-38": {
      "template": "A fine hunt! You have already claimed the kraken’s spoils. I am still writing the incident report."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.choice-39": {
      "template": "How did the cape turn out?"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.receipt-40": {
      "template": "A triumph of maritime understatement. Wear it proudly."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.intro-42": {
      "template": "I’m Ahab. That’s the Pequod at the berth. Out past the last buoy the fog can swallow the whole shoreline, so I check everyone’s gear while I can still see it. Equip a railgun under Character → Gear → Weapon before we set sail."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.question-43": {
      "template": "What counts as sufficiently powerful?"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.choice-44": {
      "template": "Ask about equipment"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.receipt-45": {
      "template": "The first time I went to sea, I mistook bravery for having no plan. I’ve since amended the plan to include a weapon with reach. There aren’t any shops once we’re out past the buoys."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.intro-47": {
      "template": "That railgun will do. Let me check the mooring line. The Pequod makes an awful fuss about leaving the berth and settles right down once she’s on open water. I know sailors who do exactly the same thing."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.question-48": {
      "template": "What happened to Moby Dick?"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.choice-49": {
      "template": "Ask about Moby Dick"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.decline-50": {
      "template": "Leave"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.label-52": {
      "template": "What happened to Moby Dick?"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.intro-54": {
      "template": "Too hard. We’ll just hunt the kraken instead."
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.question-55": {
      "template": "Board the Pequod for the kraken hunt?"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.choice-56": {
      "template": "Board the Pequod"
    },
    "jurassic.ahabDialogue.decline-57": {
      "template": "Stay ashore"
    },
