    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.decline-4": {
      "template": "Another time"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.intro-6": {
      "template": "Our new colleague has submitted a paper titled “Banana.” It is devastatingly concise. The reviewers are furious."
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.question-7": {
      "template": "How is the visiting professor settling in?"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.choice-8": {
      "template": "Ask about the monkey"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.receipt-9": {
      "template": "He has tenure, a sunny climbing frame, and his own fruit budget. We have never had a more productive faculty member."
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.intro-11": {
      "template": "Ah! A volunteer! And he has already stolen my pen. Clearly a natural academic."
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.question-12": {
      "template": "Introduce your research assistant?"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.choice-13": {
      "template": "Introduce the monkey"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.intro-16": {
      "template": "We have tried advertising on academic job boards, but the benefits package was too vague. Any luck finding our new colleague?"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.question-17": {
      "template": "How is the search going?"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.choice-18": {
      "template": "Why not use a job board?"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.receipt-19": {
      "template": "The last applicant wanted a corner office. The one before that wanted an entire corner tree. I thought we should broaden our search."
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.intro-21": {
      "template": "Welcome to the California Institute of Consciousness Research. Our former field station went independent over what counts as evidence of consciousness. We need a research assistant with an unprejudiced view of the subject. Also a prehensile tail. Would you steal a monkey from the zoo? I have a very small relocation budget and a very large supply of bananas."
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.question-22": {
      "template": "Help Professor Meridian?"
    },
    "quests.monkeyQuestDialogue.choice-23": {
      "template": "Accept quest"
    },
    "rail-works.module.label-1": {
      "template": "Rail worker"
    },
    "rail-works.module.name-2": {
      "template": "Gus, excavation specialist"
    },
    "rail-works.module.description-3": {
      "template": "An excavator operator protecting a sandwich of considerable historical significance."
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.intro-5": {
      "template": "Afternoon. Stay on this side of the barrier and you can see the whole cut. I’m off the digger until I’ve finished my sandwich. If you want to know how the railway is going, you’ll get a straighter answer from me here than you will from the sign."
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.question-6": {
      "template": "What would you like to ask?"
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.decline-7": {
      "template": "Enjoy your lunch."
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.label-9": {
      "template": "How long is your lunch break?"
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.intro-11": {
      "template": "How long? Well, I remember when this sandwich was just two fields of wheat and a promising pig. The bread was warmer then. We all were."
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.question-12": {
      "template": "Go on…"
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.label-14": {
      "template": "But when did the break start?"
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.receipt-15": {
      "template": "There are stories of a time before lunch. My grandfather heard them from a man who claimed to have seen a moving excavator. We keep his photograph in the union hall."
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.label-17": {
      "template": "When will you get back to work?"
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.receipt-18": {
      "template": "Once I finish my tea. Trouble is, whenever I get near the bottom, someone tops it up. The kettle was here when they surveyed the route. It may be older than the route."
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.label-20": {
      "template": "Do you remember working?"
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.receipt-21": {
      "template": "I remember remembering it. Big yellow machine, terrible racket. Or perhaps that was the mustard bottle. The years tend to run together around the second course."
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.label-23": {
      "template": "How is the high-speed rail going?"
    },
    "rail-works.railWorkerDialogue.receipt-24": {
      "template": "Fastest lunch break in the state. We have already completed the feasibility study for the napkin. Construction of the actual napkin is pending a second environmental review."
    },
