      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_1922316883123937347_1": {
    "id": "tweet_1922316883123937347_1",
    "title": "I have always dismissed birdwatching as a hobby, but now I'm in my early 30s ...",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["1922316883123937347.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I have always dismissed birdwatching as a hobby, but now I'm in my early 30s on an 8am walk in the park...",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "And I saw a tiny creature with magnificent blue feathers on the path ahead of me, so bright and azure that I instinctively took out my camera for a photo.",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": {
        "id": "line-3",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Maybe I get it now.",
        "next": "line-4"
      },
      "line-4": {
        "id": "line-4",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "In the 1800s, people went to the forest to painstakingly collect and catalogue every possible beetle.",
        "next": "line-5"
      },
      "line-5": {
        "id": "line-5",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "In 2025, you go to the park to photograph and identify every bird.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_1937613272955650115_1": {
    "id": "tweet_1937613272955650115_1",
    "title": "If you know a lot about software, then you will recognize how poorly most of ...",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["1937613272955650115.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "If you know a lot about software, then you will recognize how poorly most of it is built.",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "But it's not poor by happenstance, it is poor by choice. And the choice of the software publisher is that they don't care about you.",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": { "id": "line-3", "speaker": "npc", "text": "This is just so sad.", "end": true }
    }
  },
  "tweet_1939169141057036320_1": {
    "id": "tweet_1939169141057036320_1",
    "title": "I think Curtis Yarvin's work is largely not very good. It's not very rigorous...",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["1939169141057036320.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I think Curtis Yarvin's work is largely not very good. It's not very rigorous and hand-waves way too many important arguments.",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "But I get why it's popular -- it's the most visible, mainstreamed work that is truly reactionary against the present day.",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": {
        "id": "line-3",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "People sense that something is awry, so they read Yarvin. I get it.",
        "next": "line-4"
      },
      "line-4": {
        "id": "line-4",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Isn't that an indictment on the contemporary intellectual scene? If Yarvin's the best writer to advance your views, then what does that say about your views?",
        "next": "line-5"
      },
      "line-5": {
        "id": "line-5",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "You'd expect much more skilled writers to show up and make these cases, but that whole scene is just paltry.",
        "next": "line-6"
      },
      "line-6": {
        "id": "line-6",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I think Yarvin's prose is actually pretty bad, which I suppose makes it even more damning.",
        "next": "line-7"
      },
      "line-7": {
        "id": "line-7",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "I could complain at length about his prose, but I think the much more important issue is the content of his writing.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_1946300882678599987_1": {
    "id": "tweet_1946300882678599987_1",
    "title": "My dad bought a book on Carl Jung from Amazon.",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["1946300882678599987.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "My dad bought a book on Carl Jung from Amazon.",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "He's a few pages in, telling me how bad it is.",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": {
        "id": "line-3",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I look. The cover looks like Dall-E. The text formatting has messy white space. The introduction's third sentence is \"Jung was not X, he was Y.\"",
        "next": "line-4"
      },
      "line-4": {
        "id": "line-4",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "The entire book is ChatGPT generated!",
        "next": "line-5"
      },
      "line-5": {
        "id": "line-5",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Self-published, print-on-demand in 2026... What do we expect?",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_1957249901248577969_1": {
    "id": "tweet_1957249901248577969_1",
    "title": "I'm always stunned by this asymmetry:",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["1957249901248577969.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I'm always stunned by this asymmetry:",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Eating 400 calories is extremely easy, a snickers two-pack. Just a little snack.",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": {
        "id": "line-3",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Losing 400 calories requires a serious,  sweaty, half hour workout (or longer).",
        "next": "line-4"
      },
      "line-4": {
        "id": "line-4",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Just existing for 4 hours also burns 400 calories.",
        "next": "line-5"
      },
      "line-5": {
        "id": "line-5",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Correct, but I cannot add another four hours to my day.",
        "next": "line-6"
      },
      "line-6": {
        "id": "line-6",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "If you want the flavor of chocolate but not the calories, maybe just put it in your mouth and then spit it out.",
        "next": "line-7"
      },
      "line-7": { "id": "line-7", "speaker": "npc", "text": "I get it, but no.", "end": true }
    }
  },
