      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_2005904716014948545_1": {
    "id": "tweet_2005904716014948545_1",
    "title": "The \"weed guy\" as cultural archetype has completely disappeared.",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["2005904716014948545.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "The \"weed guy\" as cultural archetype has completely disappeared.",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Musicians like Snoop Dogg or Wiz Khalifa who made it their whole personality are irrelevant now.",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": {
        "id": "line-3",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Legalization normalized it. There's no counterculture left in it, no edge, it's just dated.",
        "next": "line-4"
      },
      "line-4": {
        "id": "line-4",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Among movies, \"stoner comedies\" like Pineapple Express are completely obsolete.",
        "next": "line-5"
      },
      "line-5": {
        "id": "line-5",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "There's more to it! It used to be that this particular \"weed guy\" archetype selected for people who were a bit rebellious and therefore interesting.",
        "next": "line-6"
      },
      "line-6": {
        "id": "line-6",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "But now that the rebellious have moved elsewhere, the \"weed guy\" that's leftover is just tremendously boring.",
        "next": "line-7"
      },
      "line-7": {
        "id": "line-7",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Because of course marijuana tends to slow people down, make them complacent, a little lazy -- boring.",
        "next": "line-8"
      },
      "line-8": {
        "id": "line-8",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "You may not even know any of these people, because they tend to just hang out by themselves, stoned, alone, at home. This is now an antimemetic personality.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_2017367664302154170_1": {
