  "tweet_2027850363932708988_1": {
    "id": "tweet_2027850363932708988_1",
    "title": "At the start of this year I thought I was going to try to read two books a mo...",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["2027850363932708988.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "At the start of this year I thought I was going to try to read two books a month.",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I am now reading zero books for the rest of the year. Why?",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": {
        "id": "line-3",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "AI is getting so much better that I have so much more leverage on my own time that it is becoming way too expensive to spend time on reading.",
        "next": "line-4"
      },
      "line-4": {
        "id": "line-4",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Projects that previously would have taken me 1,000 hours I can now do in 20.",
        "next": "line-5"
      },
      "line-5": {
        "id": "line-5",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Everything that I've ever dreamed of creating, writing, etc., that was previously out of reach, is suddenly within reach: just another 10 hours here, another 10 hours there, having and being able to use all of this AI leverage when other people aren't, feels like a huge advantage.",
        "next": "line-6"
      },
      "line-6": {
        "id": "line-6",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "That feels like the hottest possible iron that must be struck immediately.",
        "next": "line-7"
      },
      "line-7": {
        "id": "line-7",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I've always been a standard-issue Silicon Valley nerd who's sometimes going to stay in and write software instead of going out, but now I'm feeling this stronger than ever before.",
        "next": "line-8"
      },
      "line-8": {
        "id": "line-8",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "The opportunity cost on my time has risen wildly and, funnily enough, this totally locks in my behavior.",
        "next": "line-9"
      },
      "line-9": {
        "id": "line-9",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Instead of relaxing more, doing the same amount of work, and having more free time, I am busier than ever before.",
        "next": "line-10"
      },
      "line-10": {
        "id": "line-10",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Jevons Paradox is very, very real.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_2030112252242854009_1": {
    "id": "tweet_2030112252242854009_1",
    "title": "I was reading about UChicago. In 1929, the 30-year-old dean of Yale Law Schoo...",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["2030112252242854009.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "I was reading about UChicago. In 1929, the 30-year-old dean of Yale Law School, Robert Maynard Hutchins, became president.",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": {
        "id": "line-2",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Can you imagine a 30-year-old being dean of Yale Law School today? Totally impossible.",
        "next": "line-3"
      },
      "line-3": {
        "id": "line-3",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "Our society of the young and dynamic has become a society of the old.",
        "end": true
      }
    }
  },
  "tweet_2031393748693955009_1": {
    "id": "tweet_2031393748693955009_1",
    "title": "Before the ~1980s, there was no portable music player. You'd go running, rowi...",
    "source_directory": "source-tweets",
    "source_files": ["2031393748693955009.txt"],
    "start": "line-1",
    "nodes": {
      "line-1": {
        "id": "line-1",
        "speaker": "npc",
        "text": "Before the ~1980s, there was no portable music player. You'd go running, rowing, cycling, whatever, for hours on end, in total silence, no sound other than your own thoughts. How did they do it?",
        "next": "line-2"
      },
      "line-2": { "id": "line-2", "speaker": "player", "text": "We will never know.", "end": true }
